DISCLAIMER / 免责声明

This project is intended to help music enthusiasts quickly generate sheet
music. It does NOT guarantee the quality or accuracy of the generated scores.
Automatic transcription is an inference process; results may deviate from the
original work and require manual proofreading before formal use.

本项目用于辅助音乐爱好者快速生成五线谱，不保证五线谱质量。自动转写结果为算法
推断，可能与原曲存在偏差，请人工校对后使用；请勿将本项目用于侵犯他人音乐作品
著作权的用途。

Third-party models (BS-RoFormer, piano_transcription_inference) and fonts are
subject to their own license terms.
